# Section 5.2 - Exploration du Pod depuis le noeud
$ minikube ssh -- "docker ps | grep nginx"
742ea351997d   nginx                          "/docker-entrypoint.…"   1 second ago         Up Less than a second             k8s_nginx_nginx_default_bc556b91-768e-46aa-b8d5-f528ac51e00f_0
cbf942b31d83   registry.k8s.io/pause:3.10.2   "/pause"                 14 seconds ago       Up 13 seconds                     k8s_POD_nginx_default_bc556b91-768e-46aa-b8d5-f528ac51e00f_0

